# Changes to existing StarDesk files (commit 6 of the PR).
#
# These hunks were written without access to the StarDesk source, from the shipping 1.6.0.166 client.
# File paths marked [known] appear in the client's own build paths; [inferred] means the class is known
# but its file name is a guess. [verified] means the function was located in the 1.6.0.166 binary and
# checked against its machine code (what it calls, which colour token it reads); the notes say what was found. Hunks show only the lines to add or change, anchored by the function
# they belong in, so they will not apply with `git apply` - place each by hand.

