@@ where a ThemeColorToken becomes a QColor for painting (ThemedLabel, ThemedPushButton, ToggleSwitch, ...) @@   [verified]
+    // 1.6.0.166: one small function does this. It indexes a static table of 255 ARGB values (the light
+    // palette, in ThemeColorToken order) and builds QColor(QRgb) - it never looks at the current theme.
